Error [E0510]: `core.crypto.expert.hkdf_sha256` requires an audited `#Unsafe` region
  --> tests/ui/crypto_hkdf_output_e0510_precedence.jet:5:17
    |
  5 |     _ :: expert.hkdf_sha256([], [], [], 8161)
    |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: raw crypto primitives may only run inside an explicit expert-tier gate (I1)
 Fix: wrap the call in `#Unsafe("crypto expert: …") { … }` or use `crypto.seal`/`open` instead
